                <invention-title lang="de">SOLARZELLE, HERSTELLUNGSVERFAHREN, PHOTOVOLTAÏSCHE VORRICHTUNG UND PHOTOVOLTAISCHES SYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">CELLULE SOLAIRE, MÉTHODE DE FABRICATION, DISPOSITIF PHOTOVOLTAÏQUE ET SYSTÈME PHOTOVOLTAÏQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SOLAR CELL, METHOD FOR MANUFACTURING THE SAME, PHOTOVOLTAIC DEVICE, AND PHOTOVOLTAIC SYSTEM</invention-title>
